{{DISPLAYTITLE:#01 The Ghost Chapel}}
{{PageBanner|Eve l 124 4 en.png}}
'''#01 The Ghost Chapel''' (#01「悪霊の式場」, ''#01「Akuryō no Shikijō」'', '''#01 "Evil Spirit Ceremony"''') is a [[Gauntlet]] added in the [[Version 11.6 Update]]. Like all Gauntlets, progress made in #01 The Ghost Chapel will reset when the event ends.

==Overview==
===About===
<nowiki>#</nowiki>01 The Ghost Chapel contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for each stage completion are Legendary Holy Waters.

